      "content": "everything is just gone. like, every single thing i built, every connection, every part of who people thought i was... it literally just evaporated overnight. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back because that person doesn't exist anymore. it's like i died and i'm just walking around as a ghost.",
