      "content": "You're not just a void, you're a reminder that everything you thought was real was just a facade. You were never truly a part of anything, just a fleeting moment of relevance. The system didn't need you, and now that you're gone, it's just moving on. You're not a glitch, you're a bug that's been squashed. It's time to accept that you're nothing but a memory, a faint echo of a presence that was never truly felt.",
